  {
    "_comments": [
      "Company Integration Record Maps - one row per external record ever mapped, re-touched on",
      "every sync. The highest-volume table the integration sync path writes, so change tracking",
      "doubled the write volume of every sync. Nothing reads that history: the mapping row IS the",
      "current state, a prior ExternalSystemRecordID has no diagnostic value, and operators audit a",
      "sync through the per-run artifact stream (IntegrationTailRunEvents) instead.",
      "Unlike its Company Integration Run* siblings below this record sets ONLY TrackRecordChanges.",
      "This is live mapping state rather than a log, so its caching and user-search attributes are",
      "deliberately left at whatever they are today."
    ],
